Type "cd /tmp/ai-kit/use-case-quickstart"
Enter

Sleep 500ms

Type "# Quick start: initialize AI config in any project"
Enter

Sleep 1s

Type "ai-kit sync"
Enter

Sleep 2s

Type "# Or target specific languages only"
Enter

Sleep 500ms

Type "ai-kit sync --languages=go,kotlin"
Enter

Sleep 2.5s

Type "# ⚡ Language-aware, zero-config ⚡"
Enter

Sleep 3s
